    "updated_at": "2019-07-02T21:07:02Z",
    "body": "@yiyix you appear to work for Google, so cannot sign the Participant Agreement as an individual. Instead, you need to [make your membership in the Google GitHub organization public](https://help.github.com/articles/publicizing-or-hiding-organization-membership/), or join it and then do so if you are not already a member. (Feel free to reach out to me internally for more information.)\r\n\r\nThe other thing missing for this change is web platform tests. Are any being added as part of the work in Chromium?\r\n\r\nAs for the technical merits of the new wording, I will defer to @fserb or other members of @whatwg/canvas.",
